shanshui.js is the landscape generator from {Shan, Shui}* by Lingdong Huang,
https://github.com/LingDong-/shan-shui-inf, taken from its index.html with the
browser parts removed and one hook added (MEM.onchunk, a seed per chunk). It is
distributed under its own license, reproduced here:

