SOFTWARE.

The Perlin noise inside shanshui.js is adapted by the original author from
p5.js (LGPL-2.1, https://github.com/processing/p5.js/blob/main/src/math/noise.js),
as noted in the original source.

Runtime dependencies, not bundled: nodejs (MIT), librsvg (LGPL-2.1+).
